            {
                "comment": "Prof. Johnson is really knowledgeable about the material and wants everyone to be successful. Lecture isn't the most riveting, but still not bad. Readings are helpful if you want to actually learn the material, but aren't necessary for an A. Main grades (outside of attendance) are 3 papers/projects w/ super flexible criteria & due dates.",
